These notices identify font rights separately from the project code.
They do not replace third-party licenses or add restrictions to code
covered by the MIT License above.

The HUD glyph subsets embedded in lib/wire3d_dmg.c (96-line profile)
and lib/wire3d_cgb.c are converted from the same original ASCII font
and are covered by that font MIT notice. Paths are relative to the repository.
